# Go KV Store

A simple in-memory key-value store written in Go as part of my Go learning journey.

## Features

- Set values
- Get values
- Delete values
- Interactive console interface
- Help command
- Handles values containing spaces

## Commands

```text
set <key> <value>
get <key>
delete <key>
help
exit
```

## Future Improvements

- HTTP API
- Concurrency safety (mutex)
- Persistent storage
- Unit tests